                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A really fun and challenging bullet hell! I'm more used to games like \"Vampire Survivors\" or \"Ball x Pit\", so this is definitely a step above my usual skill level, but I've had a great time with it :)\n\nThe pixel art and overall visual design are lovely, the soundtrack is incredibly catchy and energetic, and the different mechanics and boss fights are really well done. It's tough, but in a way that makes you want to keep trying and get a little further each time.\n\nAnd considering it's completely free, there's really no reason not to give it a try. Definitely recommended!\n",
